      "ArticleTitle": "[A CASE OF ASPIRIN-EXACERBATED RESPIRATORY DISEASE COMPLICATED BY REFRACTORY VARIANT ANGINA, WHICH SHOWED EXCELLENT RESPONSE TO STEROID TREATMENT].",
